         <dc:subject>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li>KEY-TEC needs someone who can accelerate lead generation</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>bring structure into customer data and build campaigns that sales can use. That fits my background: 20+ years across CRM</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>marketing automation and B2B marketing</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>on both agency and company side. I have built lead</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>data</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>automation</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>scoring and reporting flows that help marketing and sales work better and move faster.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Bag>
         </dc:subject>
         <pdf:Producer>Canva</pdf:Producer>
         <pdf:Keywords>KEY-TEC needs someone who can accelerate lead generation, bring structure into customer data and build campaigns that sales can use. That fits my background: 20+ years across CRM, marketing automation and B2B marketing, on both agency and company side. I have built lead, data, automation, scoring and reporting flows that help marketing and sales work better and move faster.</pdf:Keywords>
